<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" lang="en">
   <head>
      <title></title>
      <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
      <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
      <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
      <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
      <style type="text/css">
         .ExternalClass {width: 100%;}
      </style>
   </head>
   <body leftmargin="0" topmargin="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0">
      <table width="100%" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#00153e" style="background-color: #00153e; font-family:Helvetica; color:#ffffff;">
         <tr>
            <td align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#00153e" style="background-color: #00153e;">
               <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:480px;" align="center">
                  <tbody>
                     <tr>
                        <td align="center">
                           <br>
                           <br>
                           <a href="http://ilabank.com" target="_blank" tabindex="-1">
                           <img src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2c8e80nprabl/5cgeqYcj46Yo7Vj76b4Pph/77905df16179591bb8a8a8b3e7d44bca/ilaemails_logo.png" width="70" style="max-width:70px; display:inline-block; display:block;">
                           </a>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding: 0px 18px 9px;">
                           <br>
                           <br>
                           <a href="http://ilabank.com" target="_blank"><img align="center" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2c8e80nprabl/6zkh49EQnrOCM42IswE38I/08b5e1e20549ff2665a4c0aba3dd3a80/email.png" width="300" style="max-width:300px; display:inline-block; display:block;"></a>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding: 0px 18px 9px;">
                           <br>
                           <br>
                           <span style="text-align: center; font-size:30px; max-width:440px; text-decoration: none; color:#79ED00;">Periodic Review Long Overdue</span>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr>
                        <td align="left" style="padding: 0px 18px 9px;">
                           <p style="text-align: center; font-size:18px; color:#ffffff;text-decoration: none;">
                              Dear {!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName},<br><br>
                              Thank you for being part of the ila family,<br><br>
                              The periodic review of your account is now long overdue.<br><br>
                              As we informed you on {!Case.Periodic_Review_Sent_Date__c}, your ila accounts have been blocked for funding and payments and your debit and credit cards are now blocked for both cash withdrawals and purchases. This is because documentation required to complete the review of your account have not been submitted yet.<br><br>
                              You can continue using our services as soon as we complete the review based on your consent or the documents submitted by you.<br><br>
                              IMPORTANT: We can update your information using the services offered by the Benefit Company if you give your consent to us to access your information with iGA. You can use our app to provide your consent.<br><br>
                              You can instead visit our Service Center at Diplomatic Area during office hours to submit the following documents so that we can update your profile.<br><br>
                              {!IF(Case.pr_WathiqConsentAcceptanceRequired__c= true, "Bahraini CPR Copy", null)} {!IF(Case.pr_WathiqConsentFormRequired__c= true, "Bahraini CPR Copy", null)} {!IF(Case.pr_PassportPhotoRequired__c = true, "Passport Copy Required", null)} {!IF(Case.pr_ResidencyPermitPhotoRequired__c = true, "Residency Permit (RP) Copy Required", null)} {!IF(Case.pr_OtherDocumentsRequired__c = true, Case.Other_Documents_Required_Description__c, null)}<br><br>
                              Please arrange to provide your consent as soon as possible to continue using our services without any disruptions.<br><br>
                              Should you need any assistance, please feel free to call us on&nbsp;<a href="tel:+97317123456" style="color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;">+973 17123456</a>&nbsp;or email us on&nbsp;<a href = "mailto:support@ilabank.com" style="color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;">support@ilabank.com</a>
                           </p>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr>
                        <td style="padding-top:10px; padding-right:18px; padding-bottom:10px; padding-left:18px;" valign="top" align="center" class="mcnButtonBlockInner">
                           <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="mcnButtonContentContainer" style="border-collapse: separate !important;border-radius: 30px;background-color: #79ED00;">
                              <tbody>
                                 <tr>
                                    <td align="center" valign="middle" class="mcnButtonContent" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 25px; padding: 12px 36px;">
                                       <a class="mcnButton " title="Open ila App" href="https://gateway.ilabank.com/redirect/mobile" target="_blank" style="font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: normal;line-height: 100%;text-align: center;text-decoration: none;color: #00153e;">Open ila app</a>
                                    </td>
                                 </tr>
                              </tbody>
                           </table>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding: 0px 18px 9px;">
                           <br>
                           <br>
                           <span style="text-align: center; font-size:20px; text-decoration: none; color:#79ED00;">Follow us on social media</span>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding: 0px 18px 9px;">
                           <table>
                              <tr>
                                 <td align="center" valign="middle" style="padding: 0px 5px 5px;"> 
                                    <br>
                                    <a href="https://www.facebook.com/Ila-Bank-Bahrain-352144688790283/" target="_blank"><img src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2c8e80nprabl/1yboFPOOVPmS7O78JdWJoP/7a0bc89b71c6d839ac123f03b577d99b/ilaemails_facebook.png" alt="Facebook" style="display:block;" height="40" width="40"></a> 
                                 </td>
                                 <td align="center" valign="middle" style="padding: 0px 5px 5px;"> 
                                    <br>
                                    <a href="https://instagram.com/ilabankbhr" target="_blank"><img src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2c8e80nprabl/4RckoPxJ8MzRJuP4oJuTP2/ac2c5371d673151d35ae6c63accacb08/ilaemails_instagram.png" alt="Instagram" style="display:block;" height="40" width="40" class=""></a>
                                 </td>
                                 <td align="center" valign="middle" style="padding: 0px 5px 5px;"> 
                                    <br>
                                    <a href="https://twitter.com/ilaBankBHR" target="_blank"><img src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2c8e80nprabl/2JrAJees2RugJSieO64JzA/0070d557ef109cc562752a3d775d7a1d/ilaeamils_twitter.png" alt="Twitter" style="display:block;" height="40" width="40" class=""></a>
                                 </td>
                                 <td align="center" valign="middle" style="padding: 0px 5px 5px;"> 
                                    <br>
                                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/ilabank/" target="_blank"><img src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2c8e80nprabl/4WHZQB4KgiI8rkr9M8mUTE/ac8ee952a49467abb5cb337df8bfc4cb/ilaemails_linkedin.png" alt="LinkedIn" style="display:block;" height="40" width="40" class=""></a>
                                 </td>
